# Production build-time env (public values only — this file is committed).
# Secrets NEVER go here; they live in worker secrets / CF Pages dashboard env.

# Invisible Turnstile widget "Queer Guide - Assistant" (anti-abuse on the
# public assistant endpoint). Site keys are public by design; the matching
# secret is TURNSTILE_SECRET on the queer-guide-assistant worker.
#
# The last character is a capital letter O, NOT a digit zero. It was committed
# as `…_4p830` (zero) and every widget on the site failed client-side with
# Turnstile error 400020 = "invalid sitekey". That was misdiagnosed for weeks
# as an account-wide Turnstile suspension caused by the overdue CF invoice; it
# survived the invoice being paid because it was never a billing problem.
# Verified on prod 2026-08-04 from queer.guide: `…_4p830` (zero) -> ERROR
# 400020, `…_4p83O` (letter) -> real token `1.xPZX…`, while Cloudflare's demo
# sitekey minted fine on the same page (so script/CSP/host were never at fault).
VITE_TURNSTILE_ASSISTANT_SITE_KEY=0x4AAAAAAD-JrZy2gY_4p83O
